---
/* Social Proof / Developer Use Cases */
---

<section class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-core-background relative">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-ember mb-4">
                Perfect for
            </p>
            <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl text-core-text-primary leading-[1.15]">
                Built by devs, <span class="text-brand-ember">for devs.</span>
            </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <!-- Indie Hacker -->
            <div class="group relative rounded-3xl border border-semantic-border/30 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-ember-mist/30 to-core-background opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
                <div class="relative p-10">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-brand-ember-mist flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-2xl">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-ember" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl text-core-text-primary mb-2">The Indie Hacker</h3>
                    <p class="text-core-text-disabled text-sm font-medium mb-4">Balancing a 9-to-5 with building a SaaS</p>
                    <p class="text-core-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
                        You have 2 hours after work. Blisp makes sure those hours count — pre-researched tasks, ready to code, no planning overhead.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-semantic-border/20">
                        <p class="text-sm text-core-text-secondary italic">
                            "I used to spend 45 min deciding what to work on. Now I just open Blisp and start coding."
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- CS Student -->
            <div class="group relative rounded-3xl border border-semantic-border/30 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-green-50/30 to-core-background opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
                <div class="relative p-10">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-green-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-2xl">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-sage" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/><path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl text-core-text-primary mb-2">The CS Student</h3>
                    <p class="text-core-text-disabled text-sm font-medium mb-4">Juggling assignments, leetcode, and a capstone</p>
                    <p class="text-core-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
                        Brain-dump your project idea between classes. Wake up to a structured plan with tutorials matched to your skill level.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-semantic-border/20">
                        <p class="text-sm text-core-text-secondary italic">
                            "My capstone went from 'overwhelming' to 'one task at a time' in a single brain dump."
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- OSS Maintainer -->
            <div class="group relative rounded-3xl border border-semantic-border/30 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-card transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-yellow-50/30 to-core-background opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
                <div class="relative p-10">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-yellow-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-2xl">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-flax" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"/><path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl text-core-text-primary mb-2">The OSS Maintainer</h3>
                    <p class="text-core-text-disabled text-sm font-medium mb-4">Tracking PR reviews and feature roadmaps</p>
                    <p class="text-core-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
                        Voice-dump feature ideas and bug reports as they come in. Blisp organizes them into projects with actionable next steps.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-semantic-border/20">
                        <p class="text-sm text-core-text-secondary italic">
                            "Finally, a tool that thinks about my projects the way I do — in bursts of inspiration."
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
